WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.235
[MUSIC]

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:06.910
Hi class of 22, welcome to the GSB fam.

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:10.822
I'm Kerry and I'm recording this
from the very hot Houston, Texas.

00:00:10.822 --> 00:00:14.775
&gt;&gt; Hey class of 22, welcome to the GSB,
my name is Emily, so

00:00:14.775 --> 00:00:16.684
excited that you're here.

00:00:16.684 --> 00:00:20.962
&gt;&gt; Hello class for 2022, I'm Robert
Siegel, a Lecturer at the Graduate School

00:00:20.962 --> 00:00:24.140
of Business and
also a member of the MBA class from 1994.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:26.210
We are so
excited to have him here with us.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:29.320
You're about to go through a truly
transformational experience,

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.080
the likes of which none of us have
actually really gone through the way

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.080
you're going to go through it.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.600
But we can't wait to see you in person,
we're so excited to have you here and

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.300
we want to welcome you to Stanford.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:42.820
&gt;&gt; While we can't be together as we
normally would be in the classrooms or

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:47.380
in town square, we are still
an incredibly strong community.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:51.220
&gt;&gt; We know that this is a fall
quarter unlike any other.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:55.640
&gt;&gt; I'm not sure what the new normal will
be but one thing that I can share is that,

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.663
in that new normal, I might be able
to talk with you without this mask.

00:00:59.663 --> 00:01:02.591
&gt;&gt; And it's going to be tough and
we all have to stay flexible,

00:01:02.591 --> 00:01:04.673
which is lesson number one in business.

00:01:04.673 --> 00:01:09.730
&gt;&gt; One thing I wish I knew at the start
of my GSB experience was to just breathe,

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:15.670
relax, and savor the moments that you will
undoubtedly share with your classmates.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:20.340
&gt;&gt; Whether you're on campus or online
this quarter, we are here to support you.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:24.378
&gt;&gt; Be grateful,
Stanford is a magical place and

00:01:24.378 --> 00:01:29.892
it's very easy to forget to be grateful
when you're overwhelmed by everything.

00:01:29.892 --> 00:01:35.594
&gt;&gt; Well, the GSB offers a great community
and a great communal experience.

00:01:35.594 --> 00:01:39.965
Be sure to have honest and
difficult conversations with

00:01:39.965 --> 00:01:44.343
yourself about where you are and
where you're headed.

00:01:44.343 --> 00:01:48.070
&gt;&gt; I'll leave you with
the five values of GSB,

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:52.809
engage intellectually,
strive for something great,

00:01:52.809 --> 00:01:57.869
respect others, act with integrity and
own your actions.

00:01:57.869 --> 00:02:01.495
&gt;&gt; Welcome to the GSB

00:02:01.495 --> 00:02:04.388
&gt;&gt; [MUSIC]

